  "verification_method": "Explicit public snapshot trees only; import public tree nodes, standalone private packs, then exactly the missing P02 blobs whose IDs belong to the public union. Rehash every target object in a fresh bare DB with no alternates or lazy/network fetch. No ancestry traversal.",
